justify;&quot;&gt;VLAN10 SVI -&amp;gt; 192.168.20.1&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;VLAN10 SVI -&amp;gt; 192.168.30.1&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(168, 85, 247));&quot;&gt;Routed Transit:&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;R1 G0/0 → 192.168.254.1/30&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;SW1 G0/1 → 192.168.254.2/30&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(117, 185, 143));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;DHCP Relay&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;ip helper-address 192.168.100.10&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;VLAN clients -&amp;gt; VLAN gateway -&amp;gt; DHCP relay -&amp;gt; DHCP-SRV&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(223, 139, 76));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Note:&lt;/b&gt; Scenario A and Scenario B are alternative configurations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(223, 139, 76));&quot;&gt;R1 and SW1 do not provide the same VLAN gateways simultaneously.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
